1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,211
Jesus promised paradise to a criminal.

2
00:00:03,383 --> 00:00:03,709
Why?

3
00:00:03,857 --> 00:00:06,311
Two criminals were dying on crosses beside

4
00:00:06,352 --> 00:00:06,652
Him.

5
00:00:07,118 --> 00:00:10,535
If thou be Christ, save thyself and us.

6
00:00:11,023 --> 00:00:12,236
One wanted off the cross.

7
00:00:13,004 --> 00:00:14,496
The other asked for very little.

8
00:00:15,083 --> 00:00:18,119
Lord, remember me when thou comest into thy

9
00:00:18,179 --> 00:00:18,581
kingdom.

10
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:20,161
He asked to be remembered.

11
00:00:21,574 --> 00:00:21,981
Someday.

12
00:00:22,527 --> 00:00:26,246
To day shalt thou be with me in paradise.

13
00:00:26,634 --> 00:00:27,446
Not someday.

14
00:00:28,137 --> 00:00:28,625
Today.

15
00:00:29,782 --> 00:00:30,734
Not just remembered.

16
00:00:31,445 --> 00:00:31,912
With Him.

17
00:00:33,065 --> 00:00:34,657
You can ask Him to remember you too.
